  unitName: Ice Goddess Selena
  unitId: 20014
  unitNumber: 8
  description: A swordswoman from the ruined Sama Kingdom. She is the savior of her
    kingdom, and one of the Six Heroes. During the great war she refused Sama Kingdom's
    call and led the Savat people to save the masses. Her sword, Lexida, showed its
    true power in response to her skill, cutting down the gods with a cold pale blue
    strike. She gave the people courage and terrified the gods.
  summonDesc: I was actually summoned!?<br>Amazing! Now, let me show you<br>the power
    of my Lexida!
  fusionDesc: Watch this!<br>Lexida, lend me your strength!
  evoDesc: I do not fear the gods!<br>Watch as Lexida puts them <br>in their place!
  element: 2
  rarity: 4
